	measure Ganancia_Mes = ```
			
			SUM('df_nuevas_columnas'[price]) - 
			SUM('df_nuevas_columnas'[freight_value])
			```
		lineageTag: ab9f45c2-324f-474b-b6d6-a369230d4732

